{"script":"yd_015_07-备份","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1b","layer":"chara2","y":-474,"x":-120,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara015_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1b","layer":"chara2","scaleY":1,"x":-120,"transTime":300,"y":-474,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara015_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]如果要我推荐的话，黑森林最好吃的特色菜，应该是野蕈鸡茸汤。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]那是用被魔物孢子寄生的鸟类魔物熬煮而成的浓汤，拥有层次丰富的口感和清爽的鲜甜口味。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]你说孢子寄生过的肉竟然还能吃？嗯……对外来者来说好像确实有点重口味。[r][l]但请放心，经过高温烹煮过后，至少是无毒的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]如果你有兴趣的话，非常推荐你去尝一尝。没事，只要克服第一口的恐惧就好！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"芭杜尔-黑森林的美食"}